<title>USA: TransTexas Gas extends notes tender offer.</title>
<headline>TransTexas Gas extends notes tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransTexas Gas Corp said on Wednesday it was extending an offer to exchange its outstanding 13.25 percent Series A Senior Subordinated Notes due 2003 for 13.75 percent Series C Senior Subordinated Notes due 2001.</p>
<p>The offer now expires 0930 EDT (1330 GMT) on June 19.</p>
<p>TransTexas Gas is engaged in the exploration, production and transmission of natural gas and oil.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
